@startsalt
' Screen: Agent Create / Edit Form (OpenAI variant shown)
' User Stories:
'   - As an admin, I can configure a new agent by selecting an adapter type
'   - As an admin, I can specify the model and auth credential reference for the agent
'   - As an admin, I can set governance limits (cost cap, rate limit) per agent
'   - As an admin, I can save as draft or publish the agent configuration
'   - As a developer, I can see adapter-specific fields update when the type changes

{
  <b>codefre.sh</b> | Dashboard | Scripts | Prompts | <b>Agents</b> | Schedules | Settings
  ==
  {
    [< Back to Agents]  |  <b>New Agent</b>  |  [Save Draft]  [Publish]
  }
  ==
  {
    ' Adapter type selector at top
    <b>Adapter Type</b>
    () openai  (X) anthropic  () langchain  () http  () bedrock  () vertex
    ..
    <i>Showing fields for: <b>openai</b></i>
    ==

    ' Basic identity
    <b>Identity</b>
    ..
    Name:          "gpt4o-primary                             "
    Description:   "Primary GPT-4o agent for code review and generation tasks."
    ==

    ' OpenAI-specific config
    <b>OpenAI Configuration</b>
    ..
    Model:         ^gpt-4o^
    {
      Available models:
      (X) gpt-4o          <i>(recommended)</i>
      () gpt-4o-mini
      () gpt-4-turbo
      () gpt-4
      () o1
      () o1-mini
    }
    ..
    API Base URL:  "https://api.openai.com/v1             "  <i>(override for proxy)</i>
    Auth Ref:      "secret://openai/api-key               "  [Browse Secrets]
    Organization:  "org-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX              "  <i>(optional)</i>
    ..
    Max Tokens:    "4096     "
    Temperature:   "0.2      "   <i>(0.0 – 2.0)</i>
    Top P:         "1.0      "   <i>(optional)</i>
    ==

    ' Governance
    <b>Governance & Limits</b>
    ..
    Daily Cost Cap:       "$ 25.00   "  <i>USD — halt execution when exceeded</i>
    Rate Limit:           "60        "  req/min
    Timeout:              "30        "  seconds per request
    Max Retries:          "3         "
    Retry Backoff:        ^Exponential^
    ==

    ' Metadata
    <b>Metadata</b>
    ..
    Tags:          "production, code-review, gpt4o        "   [+ Add Tag]
    Owner:         ^keith.brings@noizu.com^
    ==

    [Save Draft]  [Publish]  [Cancel]
  }
}
@endsalt
